== 3. TT dispersion by realization class (random cubic-generic allowed terms) ==
L (both compact)                                : omega_TT exponents p = 2.999, 2.999   (omega ~ k^p); all omega^2 > 0: True
A (E integer, h compact)                        : omega_TT exponents p = 2.000, 2.000   (omega ~ k^p); all omega^2 > 0: True
B (h integer, E compact)                        : omega_TT exponents p = 2.001, 2.001   (omega ~ k^p); all omega^2 > 0: True
N (both polynomial; not a rotor/qubit class)    : omega_TT exponents p = 1.001, 1.003   (omega ~ k^p); all omega^2 > 0: True
NOTE: in N, K_N on TT = |E_TT|^2 and h:R on TT = q^2|h_TT|^2 > 0 (09-14 note); here random positive K0 stands in for K_N on TT.
